{"v":1,"accession":"PRJNA394753","title":"Impact of daytime nitrogen limitation on structure and function of mixed microalgal communities derived from three geographically distinct sources","description":"An analysis of three algal communities derived from a separate inocula sourced from surface water and/or wastewater treatment plant clarifiers in each of three distinct geographic locations in the continental United States. Communities were cultivated under daytime N-limitation in photobioreactors with 8-day solids residence time for 82 days during which time 10 samples from each reactor were collected for DNA analysis. DNA was amplified using primers for V4 and V8-V9 regions of the 18S rRNA gene and sequenced using Illumina MiSeq v2 Chemistry.","center":"University of Illinois at Urbana-Champaign","data_type":"Other","submission_date":"2017/07/17 00:00","sample_cols":["accession","title","tier","context","collection_date","collection_year","country","region","place_id","place","location_status","lat","lon","submitted_location","isolation_source","env_broad_scale","env_local_scale","env_medium","eligibility_reason"],"samples":[["SAMN07358711","Metagenome or environmental sample from aquatic metagenome","probable_urban","municipal_wastewater","2015-10-25",2015,"US","Florida",null,null,"conflicting",27.9506,-82.4572,"USA: Crystal River, Florida and Tampa, Florida","freshwater pond, Three Sisters Spring, Purity Springs, Hillsborough River, Secondary wastewater weir",null,null,null,"urban context stated at BioProject level only"],["SAMN07358712","Metagenome or environmental sample from aquatic metagenome","probable_urban","municipal_wastewater","2015-10-25",2015,"US","Florida",null,null,"conflicting",27.9506,-82.4572,"USA: Crystal River, Florida and Tampa, Florida","freshwater pond, Three Sisters Spring, Purity Springs, Hillsborough River, Secondary wastewater weir",null,null,null,"urban context stated at BioProject level only"],["SAMN07358713","Metagenome or environme